[[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238832\">7040G36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238703\">7015A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3239008\">7095B82</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Rear window wiper motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236988\">N16</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>3. Remove the motor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019577.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the motor is undamaged.</p><p>1. Check the sealing pad on the wiper motor shaft is undamaged and\ncorrectly positioned.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019578.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<p>Position the motor and secure with bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Check the operation of the rear wiper motor.</p><p><a href=\"#/3239008\">7095B82</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238703\">7015A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238832\">7040G36</a></p>"]]